  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extending Mobile Applications in Africa through Social Networking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to marry together infoDev&apos;s experience with ICT-enabled innovation and entrepreneurship, in particular its African network of business incubators, with Mobile Monday&apos;s model of encouraging innovation in the mobile sector through social networking in the business community, in order to extend mobile applications in Africa. By the end of the project, it is hoped that four African chapters will be functioning successfully on a self-sustaining basis and that a platform will have been created for the formation of additional chapters in other African cities.</narrative>
  </description>
